('4fdd1c0c-dcff-44fd-b75f-08344b95da06', 'https://www.linkedin.com/sales/lead/ACwAAAh-J9MBoilvPI8GeydFvyGZ73mA_IzVsj8,NAME_SEARCH,8hgK', 'Kevin', 'Bessat', 'Global Head of Channel & Partnerships', 'Lyon, Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes, France', 'OneStock', '11280951', (SELECT id FROM entreprises WHERE company_id_linkedin = '11280951' LIMIT 1), 2, 9, 2, 9, 'ACwAAAh-J9MBoilvPI8GeydFvyGZ73mA_IzVsj8', 'Since 2023, I lead Partnerships at OneStock with purpose and a long game in mind. I built our partner ecosystem from the ground up and turned it into a key driver of global growth—powered by a small but fierce team of Partner Managers who bring brains, heart, and hustle to the table every day.

We don’t chase logos. We build trust. We choose partners carefully, commit deeply, and focus on real outcomes over vanity metrics. That’s the mindset we share.

OneStock is a leading OMS platform trusted by 100+ brands in 30+ countries, processing €2.5B+ in annual order volume. Now backed by Summit Partners, we’re scaling fast—especially in the U.S.—and partnerships are at the core of that expansion.

I like to operate with a stoic mindset: control what you can, adapt to what you can’t, and never mistake movement for progress. 

Outside the office, I find clarity in nature—trail running, mountain air, and a camera in hand. It’s where I reset, reflect, and reconnect.

I’m active here on LinkedIn, sharing real lessons (and real laughs) from the front lines of partnerships.
If that resonates, let’s connect.', 'At OneStock, I spearhead the development of a robust System Integrator (SI) network and a comprehensive ecosystem of Independent Software Vendors (ISVs) across key global territories, including France, the UK, Italy, Germany, the Nordics, North America, and beyond.
Leading a high-performing team of Partner Managers across regions, I have built this network from the ground up, ensuring alignment with OneStock’s strategic objectives and global footprint.

OneStock is the European leader in Order Management Systems (OMS), enabling omnichannel retailers to unify inventory across e-commerce, warehouses, stores, suppliers, and more. By leveraging OneStock’s advanced capabilities—including Customer Promise, Ship From Store, Order in Store, Unified Click & Collect, and Reserve & Collect—retailers can optimize logistics, increase operational efficiency, and elevate customer experiences.

With a focus on scalability and mutual value creation, I have implemented structured partner programs that ensure measurable impact. 
This includes:
Creating clear go-to-market strategies for each partnership.
Driving revenue growth through co-selling and targeted account collaboration.
Establishing rigorous frameworks for lead generation, partner enablement, and deal influence.

My mission is to ensure OneStock’s partnerships not only amplify business growth but also redefine how retailers achieve omnichannel success globally.', '1st', False, False, 69, 'https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E03AQGcY41y08X55A/profile-displayphoto-shrink_800_800/profile-displayphoto-shrink_800_800/0/1699897771553?e=1765411200&v=beta&t=D3O53rbQFD_QGqID7hVOT55djXKdO60mC-Wrop99t_U', 'https://linkedin.com/in/kevin-bessat', 'https://www.linkedin.com/sales/search/people?query=(recentSearchParam%3A(id%3A5264073940%2CdoLogHistory%3Atrue)%2Cfilters%3AList((type%3ACURRENT_COMPANY%2Cvalues%3AList((id%3Aurn%253Ali%253Aorganization%253A10152136%2Ctext%3ADigilityx%2CselectionType%3AEXCLUDED%2Cparent%3A(id%3A0),
